$6.91\times$ & $(0.05,\,0.9003)$ & $200000/28943$ & $6.910133\ldots$\\
$4.35\times$ & $(0.05,\,0.8106)$ & $200000/45986$ & $4.349150\ldots$\\
$29.1\times$ & $(0.02,\,0.9853)$ & $500000/17203$ & $29.064698\ldots$\\
